      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The same issue applies to the Steadycam feature, made a separate report about it as at the core these features are fundamentally different. But depending on the implementation it might make senes to fix both at the same time: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrccamerasettings-depthtexturemode-doesnt-affect-steadycam",
